    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a cryo-1 (250 µm) nozzle along a 13466 µm G-code path at 25.08 mm/min to fill a 13700 µm footprint at 227 µm line pitch, and report filament mass, deposition rate and print time.",
    "rationale": "Single-pass extrusion of bioink through a 250 µm cryo nozzle. Extrusion volume is the cylinder of the nozzle bore over the 13466 µm path; print time is the path length at the 25.08 mm/min feed rate; fill lines are the footprint width divided by the 227 µm centre-to-centre pitch (ceiling). Filament mass = extruded volume × ink density (1.021 g/cm³); deposition rate = extruded volume ÷ print time. Assumes continuous extrusion with no non-printing travel moves and a full-bore filament.",
